    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual little game I created to reminisce about my childhood\u2014those moments after school when I would toss my backpack aside and play dominoes before my parents got home. I recreated the home of my childhood and incorporated all the essential functions needed for placing dominoes, while keeping the game pure and simple.Enjoy playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872880/extras/eac0cb12ddddcb809a064174c905eefa.avif?t=1755051599\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Environment:</strong> Step into a meticulously recreated childhood room, complete with a background TV playing custom animations, <strong>full of atmosphere</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeform Building System:</strong> Place base dominoes and rotate them <strong>with precision</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Editing Tools:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >delete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify materials using <strong>dropper/brush tools</strong> (for color/texture)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeze/Lock</strong> to prevent accidental touches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snap-to-grid</strong> alignment assistance</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual little game I created to reminisce about my childhood\u2014those moments after school when I would toss my backpack aside and play dominoes before my parents got home. I recreated the home of my childhood and incorporated all the essential functions needed for placing dominoes, while keeping the game pure and simple.Enjoy playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872880/extras/eac0cb12ddddcb809a064174c905eefa.avif?t=1755051599\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Environment:</strong> Step into a meticulously recreated childhood room, complete with a background TV playing custom animations, <strong>full of atmosphere</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeform Building System:</strong> Place base dominoes and rotate them <strong>with precision</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Editing Tools:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >delete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify materials using <strong>dropper/brush tools</strong> (for color/texture)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeze/Lock</strong> to prevent accidental touches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snap-to-grid</strong> alignment assistance</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
